  "text": "Some night sweats, initial nausea-only lasted a few days.\nThis drug has changed my life, and the turnaround was immediate.\nI went from years of depression and had tried Paxil, Wellbutrin, and a number of other drugs that I simply could not tolerate.\nMy doctor augments this with 25 mg of Traozodone for sleep.\nI sleep for the first time in 30 years and wake up feeling great.\nI am positive, optomistic and am never \"Blue\".\nI can have a sad moment over something that is truly sad.\nI don't ever sweat the small stuff and am doing great.\nI highly recommend this.\nFor the first time I am living, loving, and enjoying life--not just sitting at the sidelines watching it go by.\n",
